esults to images with the attribute label.</i>'=>'Attribute - <i>將搜尋結果限制為帶有 attribute 標籤的圖像。</i>','Sharealike - <i>restricts search results to images with the sharealike label.</i>'=>'Sharealike - <i>將搜尋結果限制為帶有 sharealike 標籤的圖像。</i>','Noncommercial - <i>restricts search results to images with the noncomercial label.</i>'=>'Noncommercial - <i>將搜尋結果限制為帶有 noncomercial 標籤的圖像。</i>','Nonderived - <i>restricts search results to images with the nonderived label.</i>'=>'Nonderived - <i>將搜尋結果限制為帶有 nonderived 標籤的圖像。</i>','icon'=>'圖示','small'=>'小','medium'=>'中','large'=>'大','xlarge'=>'特大','xxlarge'=>'超大','huge'=>'巨大','Face'=>'人臉','Clipart'=>'美工圖案','Lineart'=>'線條畫','Safety level'=>'安全等級','Moderate (default)'=>'中等（預設）','Active'=>'嚴格','Off'=>'關閉','Not filtered by license (default)'=>'不依授權篩選（預設）','Labeled for reuse with modification'=>'標示為可修改後重複使用','Labeled for reuse'=>'標示為可重複使用','Labeled for noncommercial reuse with modification'=>'標示為可修改後非商業重複使用','Labeled for noncommercial reuse'=>'標示為可非商業重複使用','More than 400x300'=>'大於 400x300','More than 640x480'=>'大於 640x480','More than 800x600'=>'大於 800x600','More than 1024x768'=>'大於 1024x768','More than 2Mpx'=>'大於 2Mpx','More than 4Mpx'=>'大於 4Mpx','More than 6Mpx'=>'大於 6Mpx','More than 8Mpx'=>'大於 8Mpx','More than 10Mpx'=>'大於 10Mpx','Image format'=>'圖像格式','Panoramic'=>'全景','Animated'=>'動畫','Restricted domains'=>'限制網域','One domain per line'=>'每行一個網域','Leave empty to disable it'=>'留空以停用','Add domains here if you want image <strong>only</strong> from these domains.'=>'如果您希望圖像<strong>僅</strong>來自這些網域，請在此新增網域。','Blacklisted domains'=>'封鎖清單網域','Add domains here if you want to blacklist them from results.'=>'如果要從結果中排除某些網域，請在此新增。','<b>It\'s required</b> to provide your own Pexels <b>API Key</b>. You must follow the process. Registration is <a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/join-consumer/">here</a>. Application creation and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/api/new/">API Id are on this page</a>.'=>'<b>必須</b>提供您自己的 Pexels <b>API Key</b>。請依流程操作。註冊在<a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/join-consumer/">這裡</a>。應用程式建立與 <a target="_blank" href="https://www.pexels.com/api/new/">API Id 在此頁面</a>。','Chinese (Taiwan)'=>'中文（台灣）','Resolution'=>'解析度','Small (4MP)'=>'小 (4MP)','Medium (12MP)'=>'中 (12MP)','Large (24MP)'=>'大 (24MP)','Minimum photo size'=>'最小照片尺寸','From now on, <b>it\'s required</b> to provide your own <b>username</b> and <b>api key</b>. You can register in Pixabay website <a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/en/accounts/register/">here</a> and get api username/key <a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/api/docs/">here</a>'=>'從現在起，<b>必須</b>提供您自己的 <b>username</b> 與 <b>api key</b>。您可以在 Pixabay 網站<a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/en/accounts/register/">這裡</a>註冊，並在<a target="_blank" href="https://pixabay.com/api/docs/">這裡</a>取得 api 使用者名稱/金鑰','Pixabay username'=>'Pixabay 使用者名稱','Api key'=>'Api key','Vector image'=>'向量圖像','Horizontal'=>'水平','Vertical'=>'垂直','Minimum width'=>'最小寬度','px minimum for width'=>'寬度最小 px','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','px minimum for height'=>'高度最小 px','Safesearch'=>'安全搜尋','<b>It\'s required</b> to provide your own <b>api key</b>. You can register in Stability AI website <a target="_blank" href="https://platform.stability.ai/account/keys">here</a> and get api key.'=>'<b>必須</b>提供您自己的 <b>api key</b>。您可以在 Stability AI 網站<a target="_blank" href="https://platform.stability.ai/account/keys">這裡</a>註冊並取得 api key。','<b>Caution: Stable Diffusion API can take a long time</b> to generate. From 4 to 9 seconds to get an image. Generation is <b>faster with SD3.5 Large Turbo</b>.'=>'<b>注意：Stable Diffusion API 產生可能需要較長時間</b>。取得圖像需要 4 到 9 秒。使用 <b>SD3.5 Large Turbo 產生更快</b>。','Model'=>'模型','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large Turbo'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large Turbo','Stable Diffusion 3.5 Medium'=>'Stable Diffusion 3.5 Medium','16:9'=>'16:9','1:1'=>'1:1','21:9'=>'21:9','2:3'=>'2:3','4:5'=>'4:5','5:4'=>'5:4',