WP All Import 相容性','Enable compatibility with the plugin "WP All Import".'=>'啟用與外掛「WP All Import」的相容性。','Compatibility with WPeMatico'=>'WPeMatico 相容性','Enable compatibility with the plugin "WPeMatico".'=>'啟用與外掛「WPeMatico」的相容性。','Compatibility with FeedWordPress'=>'FeedWordPress 相容性','Enable compatibility with the plugin "FeedWordPress".'=>'啟用與外掛「FeedWordPress」的相容性。','Compatibility with WP Automatic Plugin'=>'WP Automatic Plugin 相容性','Enable compatibility with the plugin "WP Automatic Plugin".'=>'啟用與外掛「WP Automatic Plugin」的相容性。','Compatibility with FIFU'=>'FIFU 相容性','Enable compatibility with the plugin "Featured Image from URL".<br><br> Warning: This option will not upload your images into your media anymore.<br><br> Warning 2: Does not work with DALL-E.'=>'啟用與外掛「Featured Image from URL」的相容性。<br><br> 警告：此選項將不再把圖像上傳到媒體庫。<br><br> 警告 2：不適用於 DALL-E。','Compatibility with CMB2'=>'CMB2 相容性','Enable compatibility with CMB2 plugin to set image to CMB2 field'=>'啟用與 CMB2 外掛的相容性，以將圖像設定到 CMB2 欄位','Compatibility with ACF'=>'ACF 相容性','Enable compatibility with ACF plugin (Advanced Custom Fields) to set image to ACF field'=>'啟用與 ACF 外掛（Advanced Custom Fields）的相容性，以將圖像設定到 ACF 欄位','Compatibility with Meta Box'=>'Meta Box 相容性','Enable compatibility with Meta Box plugin (metabox.io) to set image to Meta Box field'=>'啟用與 Meta Box 外掛（metabox.io）的相容性，以將圖像設定到 Meta Box 欄位','Enable cron'=>'啟用 cron','Relevant post type'=>'相關文章類型','Every'=>'每','Minutes'=>'分鐘','Hours'=>'小時','Days'=>'天','Posts date'=>'文章日期','All Posts'=>'所有文章','ago and newer'=>'之前及更新','Number of posts'=>'文章數量','Number of posts to process each time the cron is run.'=>'每次執行 cron 時要處理的文章數量。','Pro (licence expired)'=>'Pro（授權已過期）','Upgrade the plugin'=>'升級外掛','Free'=>'免費','My account'=>'我的帳號','Version'=>'版本','Verified'=>'已驗證','Not Verified'=>'未驗證','Account Details'=>'帳號詳情','Connect to pro account'=>'連線到 Pro 帳號','Pro Account'=>'Pro 帳號','Access to the WordPress.org support forum.'=>'可存取 WordPress.org 支援論壇。','Support'=>'支援','Get In Touch'=>'取得聯絡','If you have any questions.'=>'如果您有任何問題。','Tutorials'=>'教學','<a href="%s" target="_blank">Youtube Tutorial</a>'=>'<a href="%s" target="_blank">Youtube 教學</a>','Frequently Asked Questions'=>'常見問題','Reviews'=>'評論','Like this plugin? Leave a 5-star review on WordPress.'=>'喜歡此外掛嗎？請在 WordPress 留下五星評論。','Write a review'=>'撰寫評論','Donate'=>'贊助','Make a donation'=>'進行贊助','No log yet'=>'尚無記錄','Enable Logs'=>'啟用記錄','Logs history'=>'記錄歷程','Download Log'=>'下載記錄','Delete all logs'=>'刪除所有記錄','Show settings config'=>'顯示設定組態','Hide settings config'=>'隱藏設定組態','Copy settings config'=>'複製設定組態','Copied !'=>'已複製！','If you have a free or paid proxy, you can setup it here. You must use a proxy with <strong>HTTPS protocol</strong>. Use it carefully. '=>'如果您有免費或付費代理伺服器，可以在此設定。必須使用支援 <strong>HTTPS protocol</strong> 的代理伺服器。請謹慎使用。 ','You have also to check your hosting. Some rules can block requests from these proxies. '=>'您還需要檢查主機。某些規則可能會封鎖來自這些代理伺服器的請求。 ','Enable Proxy'=>'啟用代理伺服器','Address'=>'位址','Port'=>'連接埠','Username'=>'使用者名稱','Username if it requires authentication'=>'需要驗證時的使用者名稱','Password'=>'密碼','Password if it requires authentication'=>'需要驗證時的密碼','Plugin Rights'=>'外掛權限','Select which role has access to the Magic Post Thumbnail Dashboard'=>'選擇哪些角色可以存取 Magic Post Thumbnail 控制台','Choose which database you want to search for pictures. You can select multiple sources, and drag & drop each banks to give priorities on image search.'=>'選擇要搜尋圖片的資料庫。您可以選擇多個來源，並拖放各個圖庫以設定圖像搜尋優先順序。','Image Banks'=>'圖像庫','Banks Settings'=>'圖庫設定','Bing Images'=>'Bing Images','GPT Image'=>'GPT Image','Flux 2'=>'Flux 2','Gemini (Nano Banana)'=>'Gemini (Nano Banana)','Grok'=>'Grok','Ideogram'=>'Ideogram','Use the chain defined in Source'=>'使用來源中定義的鏈','Source chain: %s'=>'來源鏈：%s','Automatic generation chain'=>'自動產生鏈','Used by the editor button, bulk generation, cron and imports. Drag to reorder: the first bank is tried first.'=>'供編輯器按鈕、批次產生、cron 與匯入使用。拖曳以重新排序：第一個圖庫將首先嘗試。','No bank selected. Add at least one bank below, otherwise no image can be generated.'=>'未選擇圖庫。請在下方至少新增一個圖庫，否則無法產生圖像。','Configure'=>'設定','Configure %s'=>'設定 %s','Gutenberg block (manual search)'=>'Gutenberg 區塊（手動搜尋）','Banks shown as tabs when you search images from the Gutenberg block.'=>'從 Gutenberg 區塊搜尋圖像時，圖庫將顯示為分頁。','API keys, sizes and filters are configured in %s.'=>'API 金鑰、尺寸與篩選器在 %s 中設定。','This list is the fallback chain used by every automatic generation (editor button, bulk, cron, imports). Drag to set priority. Gutenberg search banks are chosen on the Gutenberg Block page.'=>'此清單是所有自動產生（編輯器按鈕、批次、cron、匯入）使用的後援鏈。拖曳以設定優先順序。Gutenberg 搜尋圖庫在 Gutenberg 區塊頁面上選擇。','Preview a search'=>'預覽搜尋','Test this bank without creating an image on a post. Uses the last saved API key and filters.'=>'測試此圖庫而不在文章上建立圖像。使用上次儲存的 API 金鑰與篩選器。','Preview'=>'預覽','Select a bank on the left to edit its API key, size, language and filters.'=>'在左側選擇圖庫以編輯其 API 金鑰、尺寸、語言與篩選器。','Photos'=>'照片','AI'=>'AI','Ready'=>'就緒','No key'=>'無金鑰','Untested'=>'未測試','Key OK'=>'金鑰正常','Key failed'=>'金鑰失敗','Your configuration'=>'您的設定','Automatic bank chain'=>'自動圖庫鏈','Image placement'=>'圖像位置','API keys'=>'API 金鑰','Test configuration'=>'測試設定','Loading preview…'=>'正在載入預覽…','Could not load a preview for this bank.'=>'無法載入此圖庫的預覽。','No images returned for this keyword.'=>'此關鍵字未傳回圖像。','The first bank in the chain is a generative AI service. Preview would consume credits — generate on a post instead, or put a photo bank first.'=>'鏈中的第一個圖庫是生成式 AI 服務。預覽會消耗額度 — 請改為在文章上產生，或將照片圖庫放在首位。','This bank (%s) is a generative AI service. Preview will consume tokens.'=>'此圖庫（%s）是生成式 AI 服務。預覽將消耗權杖。','Generating with AI, this can take up to 40 seconds…'=>'正在使用 AI 產生，最多可能需要 40 秒…','This preview will call a generative AI service and consume tokens. Continue?'=>'此預覽將呼叫生成式 AI 服務並消耗權杖。是否繼續？','Chain not saved yet. Generation on posts still uses the last saved chain until you click Save.'=>'鏈尚未儲存。在您點選儲存之前，文章上的產生仍使用上次儲存的鏈。','Unsaved changes'=>'未儲存的變更','You have unsaved settings. Save them before leaving this page?'=>'您有未儲存的設定。離開此頁面之前要儲存嗎？','Leave without saving'=>'不儲存並離開','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','Cancel'=>'取消','Unexpected error:'=>'未預期的錯誤：','Magic Post Thumbnail now uses a single image-bank chain for every generation path (editor button, bulk, cron and imports). Configure it under Source. Each Automatic placement can still override that chain.'=>'Magic Post Thumbnail 現在對所有產生路徑（編輯器按鈕、批次、cron 與匯入）使用單一圖像庫鏈。請在來源中設定。每個自動位置仍可覆寫該鏈。','Category'=>'分類','Tag'=>'標籤','Taxonomy'=>'分類法','AI image generation may take 10 to 60 seconds. Please be patient'=>'AI 圖像生成可能需要 10 到 60 秒。請耐心等候','First image in content'=>'內容中的第一張圖片','Default image'=>'預設圖片','Local'=>'本機','Style'=>'風格','Applied only when generating with an AI bank. Photo banks (Bing, Pexels…) ignore this.'=>'僅在使用 AI 圖庫時套用。圖片庫（Bing、Pexels…）會忽略此項。','Photorealistic'=>'寫實','Oil painting'=>'油畫','Watercolor'=>'水彩','Cinematic'=>'電影感','3D render'=>'3D 算圖','Minimal'=>'極簡','Anime'=>'動漫','Custom style'=>'自訂風格','Extra instructions appended to the AI prompt.'=>'附加在 AI 提示詞結尾的說明。','e.g. editorial product shot, soft daylight'=>'例如：產品雜誌風、柔和日光','No text on the image'=>'畫面不要有文字','Ask the AI not to render captions, titles or watermarks.'=>'請 AI 不要繪製說明、標題或浮水印。','No API key. During generation, the first image already present in the post content is used if previous banks in the chain failed.'=>'不需 API 金鑰。若前面的圖庫失敗，則使用文章中既有的第一張圖片。','Assigned when every other bank in the chain fails. Place this bank last.'=>'當鏈中其他圖庫都失敗時使用。請放在最後。','Select image'=>'選擇圖片','Remove'=>'移除','Brand overlay'=>'標題／品牌列','Disabled'=>'已停用','Title bar'=>'標題列','Title and logo'=>'標題與標誌','Draws a bar with the post title on the generated image. Disabled by default.'=>'在產生的圖片上繪製文章標題列。預設關閉。','Overlay look'=>'標題列外觀','Bar color'=>'列顏色','Bar opacity'=>'列不透明度','Text color'=>'文字顏色','Also show the first category'=>'同時顯示第一個分類','Overlay logo'=>'標題列標誌','Select logo'=>'選擇標誌','This bank does not support keyword preview. During generation it uses the first image already in the post.'=>'此圖庫不支援關鍵字預覽。產生時會使用文章中既有的第一張圖片。','Choose a default image in the settings on the left.'=>'請在左側設定中選擇預設圖片。','Regenerate'=>'重新產生','Generating…'=>'產生中…','Generation failed'=>'產生失敗','Open in Media Library'=>'在媒體庫中開啟','Ready to generate'=>'可以產生','Needs attention'=>'需要檢查','Generate a test image'=>'產生測試圖片','Creates a draft post so your live articles are left untouched.'=>'會建立草稿，不會更動已發布的文章。','This test will call a generative AI service and consume tokens. Continue?'=>'此次測試將呼叫生成式 AI 並消耗額度。要繼續嗎？','Open the test draft'=>'開啟測試草稿','Magic Post Thumbnail — test'=>'Magic Post Thumbnail — test','This draft was created to verify image generation. You can delete it.'=>'此草稿用於驗證圖片產生，可以刪除。','%s requires the Pro version'=>'%s 需要 Pro 版本','%s: no API key'=>'%s：沒有 API 金鑰','%s: key failed'=>'%s：金鑰無效','%s: key not tested yet'=>'%s：金鑰尚未測試','Add a bank to the chain first.'=>'請先將圖庫加入鏈結。','All banks in the chain are ready.'=>'鏈結中的圖庫均已就緒。','No image placement configured.'=>'尚未設定圖片位置。','Title bar will be drawn on generated images.'=>'將在產生的圖片上繪製標題列。','PHP GD is missing; the overlay cannot be drawn.'=>'缺少 PHP GD，無法繪製標題列。','Overlay is on but this server cannot draw TrueType text. Accents may break.'=>'標題列已開啟，但此伺服器無法繪製 TrueType 文字，重音符號可能異常。']];